# Shape geometry, diamond (engine backlog 14/16; DISCREPANCIES `SHAPE-AWARE-GEOMETRY`).
# A rhombus offers only its INSCRIBED rectangle to its label, and an edge
# meeting it must stop on the drawn outline, not on the bounding box whose
# corners are empty space. The parse model is unaffected by either; this
# case pins down the parse of the scenario tools/shape-check.js asserts the
# geometry for (long label + two diagonally incident edges).
figdown 0.2 flowchart
node q "Retry limit reached?" shape=diamond
node a "Alert the operator"
node b "Continue"
flow down
flowline q -[yes]-> a
flowline q -[no]-> b
